Package: vdr-plugin-image-next
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${vdr:Depends}
Description: native photo viewer and slideshow for VDR
 Browse local picture directories, view photos as a slideshow and use
 thumbnails and EXIF metadata in the VDR on-screen display.
 .
 Supports direct true-colour OSD rendering on compatible output devices,
 with the original MPEG-2 still-picture method as a fallback. Optional
 Skindesigner XML templates are included as assets for supported skins.
